{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22030","main_id":22030,"main_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","main_description":"全能美食队的龟井宗久似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2203006,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203006,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220300604,"next_line_ids":[220300605],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20271,"speaker_text_hash":3197366093,"speaker":"龟井宗久","speaker_raw":"龟井宗久","text_hash":1747400506,"text":"那是自然。无论是插花、茶道、烹饪，还是挥剑，如果不想追求极致，那就失去了从事其中的意义。","raw_text":"那是自然。无论是插花、茶道、烹饪，还是挥剑，如果不想追求极致，那就失去了从事其中的意义。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203006.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22030","main_id":22030,"main_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","main_description":"全能美食队的龟井宗久似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2203006,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203006,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":220300605,"next_line_ids":[220300606],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20271,"speaker_text_hash":3197366093,"speaker":"龟井宗久","speaker_raw":"龟井宗久","text_hash":4169766498,"text":"「极意」之道，乃是我为人之道。但是…旭东阁下却似乎和我不同…","raw_text":"「极意」之道，乃是我为人之道。但是…旭东阁下却似乎和我不同…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203006.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22030","main_id":22030,"main_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","main_description":"全能美食队的龟井宗久似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2203006,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203006,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":220300606,"next_line_ids":[220300607],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20271,"speaker_text_hash":3197366093,"speaker":"龟井宗久","speaker_raw":"龟井宗久","text_hash":3089559258,"text":"旭东阁下曾和我说，璃月有两字，叫做「中庸」。","raw_text":"旭东阁下曾和我说，璃月有两字，叫做「中庸」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203006.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22030","main_id":22030,"main_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","main_description":"全能美食队的龟井宗久似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"全能美食队·厨道的极意","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2203006,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203006,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220300607,"next_line_ids":[220300608],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20271,"speaker_text_hash":3197366093,"speaker":"龟井宗久","speaker_raw":"龟井宗久","text_hash":1478068178,"text":"意思是，无论是为人还是做事，切不可走极端，需不偏不倚，中庸平和才好。","raw_text":"意思是，无论是为人还是做事，切不可走极端，需不偏不倚，中庸平和才好。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203006.json"}
